<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Tesalonik Mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl, yii mɛkɛn pɛ daa Bot ɛ ghaada Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tɛsalonik yii Mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Tɛ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl, yii mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bot ɛ ghaada Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔl nakus zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala mɛ ghaada Tesalonik ɛ é mɛndjoŋ mɛ e ebá yii ɛkɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Bhis nyɛ nadus kɔ ghaada Filip ɛ nyɛ naazyɛ kɔ ghaada Tesalonik.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ghaada Tesalonik ɛ́ pak pɛ ɛko ɛ kyee dik Ghɛlɛs, nɛ pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo tɔ kyee dik Masedwan. Ye ɛ́ ghaada mɛbom. Mbula bɛdjoŋ nadidi ɛ́ kɔ ghaada tak, daŋ-daŋ ɛ mbula bot ɛ mbyak eYuda. Tin, bɛdhiiti bot tɔ mbyak eYuda nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi ekwyɛl mɛlyo ɛ Pɔl, wɔ gwak bɛ ɛzɛsɔ nyɛ. Pɔl nakwyal mɛkana ɛ étɛp bot ɛ Tesalonik, bot ɛ namyaal ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ na bes ɔ. Deenek, nyɛ kadjedjɛ mɛlyo mɛ ɛ, pɛ daa lɔɔ. Bɛlyoel gek ɛ́ náá, ye ɛ́ mɛkana mɛkɛn ee Pɔl nakwyal nɛ ekeletyɛ ɛ́. Ye ɛ́ di deenek ɔɔ, ye ɛ́ mɔɔ pes mɛkana mɛ mɛkɛn tɔ mɛkana mɛ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na bes.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tin, Ɛtsek ɛ mɛkɛn e mɛkana mak (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:3">1.3</ref></char>) kaada mena ɛ́, ɛgwakel Pɔl nadi nɛ yɛ nɛ bot ɛ ghaada Tesalonik ɛ. Tɔ ɛlaŋel ená kɛkum yii etɛn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:5">4.5</ref></char>), Pɔl ɛpedjɛ mɛghaaz nɛ bot ɛ Tesalonik étɛp bɛ neetɔ́ sok tɔ tsik ekeletyɛ bɛ di nɛ yɛ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak ɛ étɛp ɛkoobal zyaala nadi tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ na bes nyɛ nakus ɛ. Zyaala tak nabɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ bɛmɛlyo, kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛbula ɛ Klisto. Nyɛ ɛpebaadjɛ mɛgaaz ekeletyɛ é ɛsa mɛsa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mɛtsek mɛ mɛkana mak ɛ dáak:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Mɛswosel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1.1</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Dáa bot ɛ Tesalonik nadum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-3:13">1.2—3.13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Tsik Zɛɛb di emyaala nɛ yɛ ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4.1-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Ɛbwaalel tɔ ɛbula ɛ Klisto (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4.13—5.11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Mɛlyo nɛ mɛswosel mɛ mɛsik (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 5:12-28">5.12-28</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Ye ɛ́ mam Pɔl zɛnɔɔ Silas nɛ Timote, bis kwyal mɛkana mak ɛ́ étɛp bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Tesalonik, bot ɛ di bot ɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena dɔɔ nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ: beta náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ egwyem di nɛ nen!<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb bot ɛ Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Bis nɛ bulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb mɛlu djas kɔ ɛsu ɛ len. Eghɛŋ bis djaala ɛ́, bis nɛ baadjaala kɔ ɛsu ɛ biyɔ djas. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Sok bhwoob Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena bis nɛ taala mɛlu djas nɛ ghiŋ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ mɛsa mɛ kwyɛl zɛnɔɔ ɛbwaalel bi di nɛ yɛ nɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, bis nɛ gu náá, Zɛɛb nɛ kwyɛl bin, nyɛ nasɛ́ɛ bin ɛ étɛp bi needi bɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Deenek, é sok bis nagoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ mɛkpa nɛ mɛkpa toto. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil mɛbwala, nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ dɔɔ nɛ ɛbwaalel djas. É sok mena nadika sama ɛ́, bi nabee mɛfulu mɛ bis nadi nɛ yɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ len ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Tin, bi naabaŋa mɛfulu mes, nɛ yii Ghɛŋ. Ye nakoozodi mezuk men, bi naabalamyaal mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ mɛmyaala Sisim na Dɛɛ di edjɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>É di'enek, bi moo ɛ́ bot ɛ di náá, bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb pɛ ghaada Masedwan nɛ bot ɛ ghaada Akayi aakadu mɛfulu mɔɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Tin, ye ɛ́ kɔ kyee dik'en ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ nakan ɛgoolaa, da ye ɛ́ djala kyee dik Masedwan djas nɛ kyee dik Akayi. Tin, bot djas nɛ gu ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb, bis tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbaalii kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Bot djas ɛpelii dáa bi nabe bis é sok bis nadi pɛ yebɔ ɛ, nɛ dáa bi nakat ɛduwal ɛ bɛzɛɛb ɛ ekpaka-kpaka étɛp ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ ɛ́ tɛtɛ Zɛɛb, mot di nɛ tsik ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>Tinaak, bi ɛpebwood náá, mɔn'ɛ mot di edus pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ zyɛ. Mɔn'ɛ tak ɛ́ Yezu, mot Zɛɛb nagomal pak bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ. Ye ɛ́ mɔn'ɛ tak ɛ́ kwaapɛk mena é epɛ́ɛ e Zɛɛb di ezyɛ ɛ.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛsa ɛ Pɔl pɛ kyee dik Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, biyɔ bɛmet nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ pɛ yebɔ yii gwyes. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Bi nɛ baagu náá, é ghɛŋ sok, bis naaleeaa nɛ ɛtiigaa pɛ kɔ ghaada Filip. Tin, Zɛɛb naadjɛ bis mɛghaaz mɛ ɛgoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal tɔ boo tuub bis nadi eswak nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Etɛɛ náá, mɛlyo mɛ bis di elyo bin ɛ, ye tok esuwa-esuwa etsal. Ye tok etɛɛ náá, bis naazewo ze. Tin, bis ààsaŋ ɛkɔɔ mot. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Tin, bis zolii ɛ́ dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eebee náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel nɛ nes, nyɛ bookyeed bis, bis kɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. É di'enek, bis ààsaa náá, bot ɛ bɔs myaala nɛ nes, bi saŋ ɛ́ náá, Zɛɛb myaala nɛ nes, nyɛy mot di egu esiiza e elyem bis ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Biyɔ bɛmet nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, bis ààlii wak étɛp ɛkɔp ɛ bot, tin, ɛkwosak ɛ les nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ étɛp bis needi tɔ dɔɔb epata kɔ elo bin. Zɛɛb ɛ́ tyaasɛs yisɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààsaa náá, bot djɛ bis duu, ye nakoozodi biyɔ nɛghu bɛdhiiti bot. <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>Tin, dáa ye di náá, bis ɛ́ bot ɛ lwoma ɛ Klisto ɛ, bis nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛnɛɛg bin si mɛtiŋ mes. É di'enek, é sok bot nadika ɛ́, bis nadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛsila nɛ nen dáa moma di ekwyɛɛg bɔn bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Deenek, bis nabɛ ɛ́, bis moo nɛ kwyɛl nɛ nen dhaa tyɛ. Kwyɛl tak naasa náá, bis nàzosik kɔ ɛdjɛ bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Zɛɛb. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bis naakwyɛl ɛdjɛ bin, dɔɔ nɛ tsik'es. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi moo nɛ boo mɛtaŋ é mis mes. <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bi ɛpetaala nɛ mezuk mes nɛ etuŋ bis. Tin, bis nadi ɛ́ tɔ mɛsa mwos nɛ pum ekaab náá, bis ɛzɛkɛdi nɛ nen boo ɛbɛp, ye ɛ deenek ɛ bis di egoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Biyɔ ɛ́ di bɛtyaasɛs bis, dɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb pe ɛ́ tyaasɛs yis náá, bis nabɛ ɛ́ bis naakɛ tɔ epiki, tɔ edɛɛ, ààlyoaa djin é mis mɛ biyɔ bot ɛ zeedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Tin, ye tok nɛ mot aazyɛ zɛmwana nɛ nen dum nɛ mɛfulu mes. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Bi nɛ baagu náá, bis nadi nɛ nen ɛ dáa sɛɛg bɔn di étɛp bɔn bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>Tin, bis nabɛ ɛ́, bis naadjɛ bin mɛghaaz nɛ mɛlyo. Bis naawaab nɛ nen nɛ ghwyil djas náá, bi kɛ tɔ epiki dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. Nyɛy mot di ekwyɛl náá, bi ni tɔ ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ, étɛp bi neebela di tɔ duma yɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Bis ɛpebulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ bis nagoola bin mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ, bi naagwak yɛ. Tin, bi naamyaal yɛ dáa mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb, ààbɛ dáa mɛkpa mɛ bot ɛ bɔs. Deenek, nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ ye ɛ́ mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb, ye ɛ́ di esa mɛsa tɔ len, biyɔ bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam, bi eebaŋa ezɛɛga mendjaala Zɛɛb di pɛ kyee dik Yude ɛ, bot ɛ di tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ. Bi naazuk étɛp bot ɛ kyee dik'en, ye ɛ́ dhatyee bot ɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala menek zezuk étɛp bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>Bɛ naagó Ghɛŋ Yezu nɛ bɛngoolel-mɛkpa Zɛɛb, bɔɔ ɛ́ di ewa mena tɔ tsik mezuk. Deenek, Zɛɛb ààmyaala nɛ nɔɔ, bɛ moo ɛ́ bot ɛ bhyen ɛ bot ɛ bɔs djas. <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Deenek, bɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛlu bis náá, bis nàgoola bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal di nɛ ghwyil ɛtsik bɛ ɔ. É di'enek, bɛ ɛ́ kuku ɛbil ɛ mesyem kɔ mesyem mɔɔ bɛ di ezezyɛ nɛ ɛsesa sok ɛ. Tin, ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb moo ɛ́ kɔ lɔɔ.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ekwosak ɛ Pɔl ɛ́ náá, nyɛ baasik pɛ kyee dik Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, yɛ kabɛ bisɔ ɔ, bis bɛka nɛ nen ɛ edi ba mɔn ɛwala batsa, mena bɛkaka ɛ́ edi, tin, menaka ɛ́ edi wat tɔ sisim. Bis ɛ́ nɛ boo ɛkwosak náá, mena baabomaka, dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ bis di esa mɛghaaz étɛp ɛkum pɛ yibɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Bis ɛpekwyɛl náá, bis baazyɛ pɛ yibɔ. Deenek, mam Pɔl, esok nɛ esok mɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛzyɛ penek, tin, Satan nadi elu bis. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Deenek, ye tok bɛdhiiti bot, ye ɛ́ biyɔ ɛ́ di ɛbwaalel ɛ les nɛ mɛmyaala mes, bi ɛ́ kɔtɔ duu yes ee bis aadiig bet é mis mɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu é sok nyɛ aabula ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Deenek, nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ biyɔ ɛ́ di edjɛ bis duma nɛ mɛmyaala!<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Tin, dáa ye nadi náá, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛmaad ɛ, bis naabee náá, ye goka ɛ́ bis lik bisɔ bɛmet kɔ ghaada Atɛn. <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>Deenek, ye bɛ ɛ́ bis eekyeed mɔn nyɛɛg'es Timote mot bis nɛ bɛ nɔɔ di egyee tɔ mɛsa mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto ɔ. Nyɛy ɛ́ di egoka ɛ nɛ ɛdjɛ bin ghwyil nɛ mɛghaaz étɛp ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>Deenek, mot ngɔt tɔ len needi ààkwyit tɔ mɛtiiga mɛ bɛ di etiig bis ɛ. Bi nɛ gu biyɔ bɛmet náá, etɛp djas ee bis di ebee wak ɛ, ye ɛ́ Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet ɛ nadi ekwyɛl náá, bis boma nɛ yɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Eghɛŋ bis nadi pɛ yebɔ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bis naalɛɛ bin náá, bis ɛ́ waatiigaa. Ye ɛ́ sa bis di boma nɛ yɛ ɛ, bi nɛ gu yɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Dáa mɛ nadi ààkabɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛmaad ɛ, ye ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ nalwom Timote, nyɛ neezɛbaŋa bis menduk mɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb. Mɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ bwoo náá, Satan ɛzɛkɛwa bin tɔ mɛbhowal, é di'enek, pe mɛsa mɛ bis nasa kɔ ɛsu ɛ len naagwyɛ kɔ toto.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Dáa ye di náá, Timote eezebula pɛ daa les ɛ, nyɛ eebaŋa bis tɛtɛ Bhaadal dum nɛ kwyɛl dɔɔ nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ eelɛɛ bis náá, bi nɛ taala bis ɛbuɛpe, ɛkwosak ɛ len ɛ náá, mena baabomaka dáa bisɔ pe baadi ekwos ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>É di'enek bɔn nyɛɛg, tɔ etuŋ nɛ mezuk mes djas, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb naadjɛ bis mɛghaaz. <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Nenak, bis ɛ tɔ mɛmyaala nɛ tsik etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ ghiŋ tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>«Ha!» Bis aadi ààbulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb dhaa nyel tin dáa, dhi bisɔ ebee mbi mɛmyaala mɛ bi di edjɛ bis é mis mɛ Zɛɛb ɛ? <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Mwos nɛ pum bis nɛ wa zii é ɛdjaala Zɛɛb étɛp mena neebaabomaka. Etɛɛ náá, bis neebaadjɛ bin sa bi di ààbɛ nɛ yɛ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Beta náá, Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena nyɛy ɛmet nɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu djɛ bis ze mɛ ɛzyɛ pɛ yibɔ! <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Beta náá, Ghɛŋ sa náá, kwyɛl bi di nɛ yɛ pak'en, nɛ kwyɛl bi di ekwyɛl bot djas ɛ gheetetɔ́ sok. Tin, kwyɛl tak goka nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ dáa kwyɛl bis di ekwyɛl bin ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Beta náá, Ghɛŋ djɛ bin mɛghaaz étɛp bi needi bot ɛ na dɛɛ ààbɛ nɛ ndjɛ é mis mɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'enaka, nɛ é sok Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu aazyɛ nɛ bot bɛ djas ɛ. Amɛn!<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛfulu mɛ Zɛɛb di emyaala nɛ yɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, bis naazelyaal bin dáa bi di egoka nɛ ɛkɛ ɛ étɛp Zɛɛb neemyaala nɛ nen ɛ. Tsɛɛtsɛ, bi nɛ sa yɛ. Nenak, bis ɛpedjaala nɛ nen nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu, baasaka kɛdhaa ee bi nadi esesa sok ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Tin, bi nɛ gu mɛlyo mɛ bis zedjɛ bin dum nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu ɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="1TH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Gwakeka ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb: Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi bot ɛ na dɛɛ, sa bi ààdi tɔ membyam. <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>Deenek, mot nɛ mot gu ɛbaal ɛ nyel'ɛ tɔ é dɛɛ nɛ duu djas. <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>Sa wɔ ààbet náá, embee mɛkwosak dhaa wɔ ghwyil, dáa bot ɛ di ààdi bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, bot ɛ di ààgu Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Tin, tɔ etɛp bak, sa mot ààsa mɔn nyɛɛg ɛbiyo, nɛghu ɛkɔɔ nyɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bis eelɛɛ bin, bis naadul bin mɛlɔ náá, Ghɛŋ ɛ waawa bot ɛ di esa membi etɛp binek ɔ é feŋ. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Tin, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjóo mena étɛp mena needika tɔ mɛzɔ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp mena needika tɔ é dɛɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Ye ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ, di náá, mot di ebyen mɛlyo mak ɔ, nyɛ ààbyen mot. Tin, nyɛ byen ɛ́ Zɛɛb mot di edjɛ bin Sisim na Dɛɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>É di'enek, bi tok nɛ gwyes náá, bɛ kwyal bin mɛkana kɔ ɛsu ɛ kwyɛl pak'en. Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb naalyaal bin dáa bi di egoka nɛ ɛkwyɛla pak'en ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Kwyɛl tak ɛ, bi di etel nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bin djas di tɔ Masedwan ɔ. Tin, bɔn nyɛɛg bis, bis ɛpedjɛ bin mɛghaaz étɛp bi neebaasa dhaa ee bi nadi esesa sok ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Tin, saaka náá, bi di tɔ egwyem, waka lyem tɔ etɛp bin ɛmet, saka mɛsa nɛ nɛ mɛmbɔ men ɛmet, dáa bis naloolyo bin ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>É di'enek, mɛfulu men é mis mɛ bot di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, yɛ waasa náá, bɛ djɛ bin duu. Tin, bi aanàdi ɛbɛp étɛp dhiiti mot.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛbula ɛ Ghɛŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, ɛkwosak ɛ les ɛ́ náá, bi gu etsɛɛtsɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ, etɛɛ náá, bi needi ààdi nɛ mɛnwyaad tɔ lyem dáa bɛdhiiti bot, bot ɛ di ààdi nɛ ɛbwaalel ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Bis nɛ ɛmyaal náá Yezu naagwyɛ gom bhis ɛsyee. Tin, bis nabaamyaal náá, kɔ lo ɛ Yezu, Zɛɛb ɛ waagomal bot djas nagwyɛ bɔɔ edum koŋ nɛ Yezu ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Beeka sa bis di elyo bin dum nɛ mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ. Ye tok náá, bot aalik nɛ tsik kɔ bɔs é ghɛŋ Ghɛŋ aazyɛ ɔ aapaaleebyet tɔ́ tɔ gwoo, ɛsok nɛ bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>É di'enek, bot waagwak boo tsim ekomande, gwood boo kukuma efofop, zɛnɔɔ bham tɔŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, Ghɛŋ nyɛ ɛmet aasul tɔ gwoo. Deenek, bot ɛ nazegwyɛ bɔɔ edum ɛ koŋ nɛ Klisto ɔ, bɔɔ ɛ́ aapaadi bot ɛ mɛkɛn é ɛgom. <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>Bhii tak, bot aadi nɛ tsik kɔ bɔs dwoo lɛɛg ɔ, bɛ waabyet sama nɛ bot ɛ́ nazegom bhis ɛsyee ɔ tɔ́ tɔ gwoo, tɔ eguud pɛ ɛko étɛp ɛkɛboma nɛ Ghɛŋ. É di'enek, mena aakadika ɛ́ kɔm-kɔm sama nɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Djɛelka mɛghaaz pak'en nɛ mɛkpa mak.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s">É bhwood ɛlu ɛ Ghɛŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, bi tok nɛ gwyes náá, bɛ kwyal mɛkana kɔ ɛsu etɛp bak étɛp bi neegu ɛwala nɛ dwoo etɛp bak djas aasael ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Etɛɛ náá, biyɔ bɛmet nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, dwoo Ghɛŋ aabula ɛ, yɛ aadi ɛ́ zaka. Tin, nyɛ aazyɛ ɛ́ é pum dáa mot djii. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Eghɛŋ bot aakeke náá: «Bis ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe, bis ɛ́ tɔ egwyem ɛ» É di'enek ɛ́, mezuk aatuula kɔ lɔɔ zaka, dáa moma di egwak ɛbɛl ɛ. Tin, mot ngɔt aanàkwaadi kiid e mezuk menek. <verse eid="1TH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Deenek, biyɔ bɔn nyɛɛg, bi tok tɔ ghooghom etɛɛ náá, dwoo tak neetuula bin zaka dáa mot djii di etuula tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ biyɔ djas ɛ́ bot ɛ gwyɛ, bot ɛ mwos. Tin, mena tokeka bot ɛ pum, ààbɛ bot ɛ ghooghom. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Tin, sa mena ààdjaakasi dáa bɛdhiiti bot, mena goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ ndjem, nɛ ɛdi ɛ bot ɛ di edil elyem ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Bot ɛ́ di edja gɔ ɔ, bɛ dyeebadja gɔ ɛ é pum. Bot di edɛ mɛnyok ɔ, bɛ dyeebadi nɛ elangi tak ɛ é pum. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Yɛ kabɛ menabɛlka bot ɛ mwos ɔ, mena gokaka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi bot ɛ ɛdil ɛ lyem. Djhoonɔɔka ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ kwyɛl dáa ghun, da ɛbwaalel ɛ tsik ɛdi dáa kɔtɔ dɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Deenek, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjóo mena étɛp nyɛ neepɛ́ɛ mena, tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp mena needika nɛ tsik nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>Klisto nagwyɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛlena, étɛp mena needika nɛ tsik sama nɛ nɛ ye nakoozodi náá, menaka ɛ́ ndjem, nɛghu menaka ɛ́ é gɔ́. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Djɛelka mɛghaaz nɛ lyoel pak'en tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb dáa bi di boozezyɛ nɛ ɛsesa sok ɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo mɛ mɛsik nɛ mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, bis waab nɛ nen náá, bi duwal bot ɛ di esa mɛsa pak'en ɔ, bot ɛ Ghɛŋ nalwom bɛ náá, bɛ djɛɛd bin nɛ ɛdul ɛ bin mɛlɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Tin, lyaalka bɛ náá, bi nɛ looba nɛ nɔɔ, bi ɛ́ nɛ kwyɛl nɛ nɔɔ dhaa tyɛ étɛp mɛsa mɛ bɛ di esa ɛ. Dika tɔ egwyem pak'en.<verse eid="1TH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, bis ɛpedjɛ bin mɛghaaz náá: Dulka elɛtɛ bot mɛlɔ, djɛka bot ɛ di nɛ bwoo ɔ, mɛghaaz, kwyeeka bɛtsakbel ɛ bot, dika nɛ ɛmaad ɛ lyem nɛ bot djas. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Bi ɛkobaka, sa mot ààbulal ɛbiyo nɛ ɛbiyo. Tin, gheesaaka enɛm esa pak'en dɔɔ nɛ bot djas.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Dika mɛlu djas tɔ mɛmyaala. <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>Djaalaka ngwyis, <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>bulalka bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb é etɛp djas, yenek ɛ́ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb dum nɛ biyɔ bot ɛ di tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Sa bi ààlu Sisim na Dɛɛ náá, nyɛ sa mɛsa mɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>Sa bi ààdyamal mɛkpa mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>Tin, sɔska etɛp djas, da bi ɛbaal sa di nyɔ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>Tsetaka nɛ membi mɛ esa djas di ebiyo ɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Beta náá, Zɛɛb nyɛy ɛmet mot di ɛsuk egwyem ɔ, sa náá, bi di tɔ edɛɛ nyel djas. Deenek, nyɛ baal esisim ben, Sisim Zɛɛb di tɔ len ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ mɛnyel men, étɛp bi needi ààbɛ nɛ ndjɛ dwoo Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto aabula ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Mot nadjóo bin ɔ, nyɛ aasa náá etɛp binek djas sael etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ sosoob.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, djaalaka pe étɛp'es.<verse eid="1TH 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, swoska bɔn nyɛɛg bin nɛ mɛbeedela dáa bɛ tɛtɛ bɔn nyɛɛg.<verse eid="1TH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Deenek, mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nen nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ náá, bi laa mɛkana mak é mis mɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bin djas tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Betka náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto di nɛ nen.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
